{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was inspired by the fun that is experienced when playing with your friends. Blam! Blam! is a top down shooter that allows you to play with up to 11 friends. It is intended to be a lot of quick fun for when the inevitable 7 people jump into a voice chat and ask hey what are we playing tonight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to run into a match as equal teams or prove you're the best by taking them all on!<br><br>Pick whichever game mode sounds the most fun. (TDM, FFA, CTF, Domination, GunGame)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of our maps and battle till the last soldier standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149730/extras/e5162522ad2c10836249bfa178de4ef1.avif?t=1770844562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149730/extras_big/e5162522ad2c10836249bfa178de4ef1.avif?t=1770844562 width=800 height=620 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corridor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149730/extras/37393a06030e39a877c7f87a698602c8.avif?t=1770844562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149730/extras_big/37393a06030e39a877c7f87a698602c8.avif?t=1770844562 width=800 height=536 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castle<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149730/extras/868aae5393f19c6435596707913c0104.avif?t=1770844562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149730/extras_big/868aae5393f19c6